  "steps": [
    "Cut tofu into 1–1.5 inch cubes.",
    "Press out excess water with paper towels.",
    "Mix tofu with ginger-garlic paste, red chili powder, black pepper, salt, and soy sauce.",
    "Let it marinate for 15–20 minutes.",
    "Mix all-purpose flour and cornflour.",
    "Add water to make a thick batter.",
    "Add a pinch of salt.",
    "Mix grinned breadcrumbs",
    "Dip each tofu piece in batter → coat with crispy mixture.",
    "Press lightly for coating to stick.",
    "Preheat air fryer to 180°C for 5 minutes.",
    "Spray tofu nuggets with oil and place in air fryer basket.",
    "Air fry at 180°C for 15–18 minutes, flipping halfway.",
    "Cook until nuggets are golden and crispy.",
    "Blend all ingredients into a smooth paste.",
    "Refrigerate for 15–20 minutes.",
    "This dip is high-protein, digestion-friendly, and pairs well with tofu nuggets.",
    "Serve crispy nuggets hot with mint hung curd dip.",
    "Garnish with lemon slice, coriander, onion, and salad."
  ],
